  "body": "Modern coastal living made easy!\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, downsizer or investor, this beautifully presented home in Orewa's sought-after Strathmill development ticks all the boxes!\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n• 3 generous bedrooms\r\n• 2 modern bathrooms, including master ensuite\r\n• Internal-access single garage\r\n• Sun-soaked, north-facing living area\r\n• Modern open-plan kitchen and dining\r\n• Central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n• Custom-built TV unit and display cabinetry\r\n• Easy-care, single-level living\r\n\r\nLOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION!\r\n\r\nEnjoy being just minutes from beautiful Orewa Beach, local cafés, shops and motorway access, with the added bonus of being zoned for Orewa College!\r\n\r\nLOW MAINTENANCE. GREAT LOCATION. EASY LIVING.\r\n\r\nHomes like this offer the perfect balance of comfort, convenience and modern style.\r\n\r\nContact Team Steenberg today to arrange your private viewing or come along to our next open home!\r\n\r\nTEAM STEENBERG | BARFOOT & THOMPSON\r\nNo Stress, Just Success!",
